    <!-- ================================================= WHY BUILD HERE -->
    <section class="pmc-whybuild" id="why" aria-label="Why build your career at PMC">
      <div class="pmc-container">
        <h2 class="pmc-whybuild__title">Build Your Career. <span>Build India.</span></h2>
        <div class="pmc-whybuild__card">
          <div class="pmc-whybuild__grid">
            <article class="pmc-whystep">
              <span class="pmc-whystep__num">1</span>
              <h3>Work That Actually Matters</h3>
              <p>Every project you touch has real impact, on governance, on communities, on the lives of millions of citizens across India. This is not consulting for the sake of it.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="pmc-whystep">
              <span class="pmc-whystep__num">2</span>
              <h3>Learn Every Single Day</h3>
              <p>From grassroots panchayats to AI-enabled governance systems, our work spans new problems, new contexts, and new ways of thinking. Curiosity isn't just welcome here, it's essential.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="pmc-whystep">
              <span class="pmc-whystep__num">3</span>
              <h3>Move Fast, Adapt Faster</h3>
              <p>PMC moves with the pace and agility of a firm that is always growing. You will not wait years for responsibility, you will own things early, figure things out, and grow through doing.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="pmc-whystep">
              <span class="pmc-whystep__num">4</span>
              <h3>Sector Depth, National Scale</h3>
              <p>Work across states, sectors, and levels of government, building expertise that is rare, valuable, and genuinely hard to develop anywhere else.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="pmc-whystep">
              <span class="pmc-whystep__num">5</span>
              <h3>Be Part of Viksit Bharat</h3>
              <p>We are working on some of the most complex and consequential challenges facing India today. If you want your career to mean something, this is where to build it.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

